<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to auction 91-day T$15 bln T-bills June 17.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to auction 91-day T$15 bln T-bills June 17.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's finance ministry will auction 91-day treasury bills worth T$15 billion on June 17, officials said on Friday.</p>
<p>The treasury bills would be issued on June 18, officials added.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
